The skills under this directory adapt material from three open-source design
projects. What was adapted is itemized in NOTICE.md next to this file.

Two of them are MIT licensed and their notices are reproduced here in full, as
the license requires. The third is Apache-2.0; no files were copied from it, so
what its terms require is the attribution and the statement of the license
recorded in NOTICE.md, plus the license reference below.

